   565	  # `secrets.` reference, and no step that writes to the registry. The
   566	  # runner's ephemeral job token (scoped by that `contents: read`) goes
   567	  # only to the two pinned actions — checkout fetches with it, and
   568	  # setup-node takes it as its default `token` input to download Node —
