    61	## Why this route exists
    62	
    63	The framework adopts a model explicitly, in a release. An Owner-signed
    64	ADR-149 amendment adds the id to the working set, and the maintainer
    65	template's `availableModels`, the price rows and the upgrade baselines follow
    66	it. That path is slow by design. Claude Fable 5.1 launched on 2026-09-01. The
    67	adoption commit (`ab56e76`, 2026-09-02) added `claude-fable-5-1` to the working
    68	set, the maintainer template and the price table, and left the VETO floor, the
    69	fallback chain and the session-default pin unchanged. Adopters received it
    70	with v1.4.0 on 2026-09-15, 14 days after launch.
   130	   `check_bash_safety.py` reuses either) and in no deny rule, so none of
