   147	   the 1M context window anyway (docs): probe R2, with the plain
   148	   `claude-opus-5-5`, reported a 1,000,000-token `contextWindow` as R3 did,
   149	   so there the suffix changes only the id `modelUsage` reports. On Amazon
   150	   Bedrock, Google Cloud's Agent Platform and Microsoft Foundry, per the
   151	   docs, Opus 4.8 and later run with a 200K context window unless the model
   152	   id carries `[1m]`, which selects the 1M window there (append it only when
   153	   the model supports 1M context). Nothing here was measured on those
