   165	   excluded read it applied from the local file alone (`get_settings`:
   166	   `ultracode` true, effort `xhigh`, source `localSettings`); so there it
   167	   applies to every session of this project on this machine. It changes
   168	   more than orchestration and effort. Per the Claude Code docs, while
   169	   `ultracode` is active the session is not held to the Agent tool's
