   183	4. **Start a new session.** The model is resolved when a session starts. A
   184	   resumed session (`claude --resume`, `--continue` or the `/resume`
   185	   picker) keeps the model it was using when its transcript was saved,
   186	   whatever the `model` setting says (docs; on Amazon Bedrock, Google
   187	   Cloud's Agent Platform and Microsoft Foundry the saved model is not
   188	   restored), so resuming a session saved before this change does not pick
