     1	# GitHub Actions — Pinned Versions Freeze Doc
     2	
     3	PLAN-006 Phase 6a (Node 24 runner audit). This document is the
     4	authoritative record of every GitHub Actions dependency used by the
     5	framework's CI workflows, with version + SHA + runtime notes. Keep in
     6	sync with workflow files.
     7	
     8	## Pinning policy
     9	
    10	- Every `uses:` line in `.github/workflows/*.yml` MUST be pinned to a
    11	  SHA, NOT a floating tag (`@main`, `@v4`). SHA pins are a supply-chain
    12	  security invariant (ADR-007 → release gate).
    13	- Dependabot (`.github/dependabot.yml`) opens PRs to bump SHAs. Each
    14	  PR runs through `validate.yml` + `coverage.yml` + `smoke-install.yml`
    15	  before merge.
    16	- The comment `# SHA-pinned: <action>@<tag>` ABOVE each `uses:` line
    17	  records which tag that SHA corresponded to at pinning time.
    18	
    19	## Current pins (as of Sprint 7 Dependabot bumps, 2026-04-13)
