    63	## Upgrade procedure (Sprint 7)
    64	
    65	For each action requiring bump:
    66	
    67	1. Wait for Dependabot PR (enabled in `.github/dependabot.yml`) OR
    68	   manually create a PR with just that one action's SHA change.
    69	2. Update the SHA + the `# SHA-pinned: <tag>` comment.
    70	3. Let CI run — validate.yml + coverage.yml + smoke-install.yml all
    71	   green.
    72	4. If CI red: investigate (usually input-schema break); find compat
    73	   path or hold bump until action releases a backward-compat version.
    74	5. Merge — then update this doc with the new SHA.
    75	6. Update `docs/BRANCH-PROTECTION.md` §Node deprecation if applicable.
